0385+  23FC             		;* Move ship according to correography table     *
0386+  23FC             		;*                                               *
0387+  23FC             		;* Data: Each byte (1 for each ship) is broken   *
0388+  23FC             		;* up into two parts. The top nibble is the      *
0389+  23FC             		;* number of frames (x4) to do a move. The bottom*
0390+  23FC             		;* nibble is the direction to move. One of 16    *
0391+  23FC             		;* directions is picked (0=no motion). 1=22.5 deg*
0392+  23FC             		;* (clockwise) up to 15=337.5 deg. Starting from *
0393+  23FC             		;* 90 deg straight up (ie: 1=112.5 deg, 15=67.5) *
0394+  23FC             		;* Note that there is no straight up motion.     *
0395+  23FC             		;*************************************************
